Scope / Escopo

This MIT License covers only the original source code, tests, scripts and
documentation written for this project. It does NOT cover, and grants no
rights to:

- the MovieLens 100K dataset, which is not included in this repository and is
  governed by the GroupLens Research terms of use
  (https://grouplens.org/datasets/movielens/100k/);
- the files in `resultados/` and the screenshots in `app/docs/capturas/`,
  which contain values derived from the MovieLens data (including per-user
  metrics keyed by anonymous MovieLens user ids). They are published for
  scientific reproducibility and remain subject to the GroupLens terms;
- the Archivo font files in `app/web/public/fontes/`, licensed under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see `app/web/public/fontes/OFL.txt`);
- third-party dependencies and container images, which keep their own
  licenses.

See "Licença e dados de terceiros" in README.md for details.

A licença MIT acima cobre apenas o código-fonte, os testes, os scripts e a
documentação autorais deste projeto. Ela não cobre nem concede direitos sobre
o MovieLens 100K, os arquivos de `resultados/`, as capturas em
`app/docs/capturas/`, a fonte Archivo (SIL OFL 1.1) nem as dependências de
terceiros. Detalhes na seção "Licença e dados de terceiros" do README.md.
